Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1790002799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790015400000, "account": {"equity": "9999.41411203356", "available_margin": "9912.0553780335616", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1790015400000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2747.13", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790015400000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "-0.411006096"}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2747.13", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790015400000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "-0.411006096"}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1790015400000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "fills_read_status": "available", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-1", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "position_id": "wf-main-1", "config": {"stop_price": "2718.090000000000000000000000", "target_price": "2812.139999999999999999999999"}}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [{"fill_id": "wf-fill-1", "order_id": "wf-fill-1", "position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "status": "FILLED", "quantity": "0.159", "price": "2749.714944", "fee": "0.1748818704384", "filled_at_ms": 1790005679999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1790005679999, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-1"], "reason": "Single MAIN LONG is fully reconciled with its fill, hedge_state is single_main with no hedge, margin_health is SAFE, and the governing policy does not mandate a stop; the 5R combined-net hedge lock is not triggered (projected exit net -0.437 vs allowed_loss_usdt 24.92325), so holding unhedged is policy-compliant and no management condition is unmet.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Position wf-main-1 is MAIN LONG 0.159 ETH-USDT, entry 2749.714944, mark 2749.44, unrealized PnL -0.043716096, as_of_ms 1790005679999.", "hedge_state reports structure_status single_main, main_size 0.159, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure_usd 437.16096 equal to gross_exposure_usd 437.16096, unresolved false.", "open_orders is empty; recent_fills shows one FILLED 0.159 LONG at 2749.714944 with fee 0.1748818704384, matching the live quantity and entry, and fills_since_last_event is empty.", "margin_health is SAFE with equity 9999.78 and available margin 9912.35 USDT at 1790005679999.", "management_policy has strategy_stop_required false, protection_armed true, stop_limit_is_informational true, protection_limit 2718.09 (the recorded structural invalidation), and duration_expires_at_ms 1790092079999 (not yet reach